WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.633
Meet TouchifyMouse.

2
00:00:01.633 --> 00:00:06.861
It turns your phone into a wireless trackpad,
keyboard and remote for your computer.

3
00:00:07.911 --> 00:00:11.357
First, open the TouchifyMouse
website on your computer,

4
00:00:11.357 --> 00:00:14.741
and download the free desktop
app, for Mac or Windows.

5
00:00:15.791 --> 00:00:19.537
Open it. There's no account to
create, and nothing else to download.

6
00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:24.589
Next, install TouchifyMouse on
your phone, from Google Play.

7
00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:30.086
Put both on the same Wi-Fi, and
your computer shows up by itself.

8
00:00:30.086 --> 00:00:33.985
Tap it to connect. Or, scan
the QR code in the desktop app.

9
00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:38.658
And you're connected. The desktop
app shows which phone is in control.

10
00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:41.871
Now your phone is a real trackpad.

11
00:00:41.871 --> 00:00:47.089
Slide one finger to move the pointer, tap
to click, and use two fingers to scroll.

12
00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:49.252
A two-finger tap is a right-click.

13
00:00:50.302 --> 00:00:53.528
Switch to Keys, and type
with your phone's keyboard.

14
00:00:53.528 --> 00:00:57.375
You also get Return, the arrow
keys, function keys, modifiers,

15
00:00:57.375 --> 00:00:58.740
and one-tap shortcuts.

16
00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:02.301
The media remote plays, pauses and skips.

17
00:01:02.301 --> 00:01:05.241
And the volume stays in
sync with your computer.

18
00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:10.552
You can even use your phone as a
microphone in Zoom, Teams or Discord,

19
00:01:10.552 --> 00:01:12.743
or hear your computer's sound on it.

20
00:01:12.743 --> 00:01:17.004
The desktop app sets up what it needs,
so there's nothing to download.

21
00:01:18.054 --> 00:01:21.055
Pick your theme, set the pointer
speed, and make it yours.

22
00:01:23.054 --> 00:01:25.615
TouchifyMouse. Free for Mac and Windows.

23
00:01:25.615 --> 00:01:26.767
Download it today.

